    "description": "BUILD-02 was closed, but the org has ZERO ConnectedApps, NamedCredentials and AuthProviders — only externalClientApps/GCP.eca. BUILD-66 outbound publish cannot be configured without this.\n\n* Create the Named Credential + External Credential per the auth mechanism WagerTech confirms: API key, OAuth client credentials, or mTLS. OAUTH IS MEANINGFULLY MORE WORK than an API key and affects the BUILD-66 estimate\n\n* One per environment, sandbox first\n\n* Integration user permission mapping\n\n* Credential handling via password-manager share ONLY — never email or chat\n\nEffort: \\~2-4h once the mechanism is known.\n\nBlocked on §7 item 2 of the CMS Integration Design doc (authentication mechanism + token lifecycle).\n\nSource: Asana Reconciliation v2, 2026-07-29, §1.",
